<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Boral has A$100 mln for acquisitions.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Boral has A$100 mln for acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Energy and building materials group Boral Ltd said on Wednesday it had up to A$100 million for acquisitions and developments it was actively seeking in the gas production area in particular.</p>
<p>&quot;There's a great deal of opportunity for acquisition in the energy area, particularly in the upstream production areas,&quot; Boral managing director Tony Berg told reporters after Boral released its first half result.</p>
</text>
